{"steam_appid":2333000,"steam_name":"Silver Pines","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/2333000/539338629/2a4a3622682e5c825f60e37dd24186d82596360a/1790858062/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1791478744","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257442465/75e8f56f0d60a079067ffba28c828fcafc56521d/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1791478744","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/a7630a1d9bee1267d7ebec560e2285aff46d82c9/ss_a7630a1d9bee1267d7ebec560e2285aff46d82c9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791483390","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/0f7aa4408737846524bdbe60d02279df99c6ab3a/ss_0f7aa4408737846524bdbe60d02279df99c6ab3a.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791483390","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/3ab713a4a26d907522067941ecff9376bd5e7401/ss_3ab713a4a26d907522067941ecff9376bd5e7401.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791483390","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/db5c8786cb3398017379a6d8d9df505b7e40eb46/ss_db5c8786cb3398017379a6d8d9df505b7e40eb46.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791483390","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/57ae4a463c25fe5a06ad03dcdefc48b9b4d3ebb9/ss_57ae4a463c25fe5a06ad03dcdefc48b9b4d3ebb9.1920x1080.jpg?t=1791483390"],"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Eddie Velvet.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Private investigator Red Walker finds himself in Silver Pines, a place half-abandoned, half-forgotten, in the middle of nowhere on a job to track down Eddie Velvet. A musician who has vanished. As the case begins to reveal a dark past, Walker soon slips into a strange and nightmarish descent beyond his control.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/00019bea2e4db97c69ee9fdca5b9319b.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/00019bea2e4db97c69ee9fdca5b9319b.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/00019bea2e4db97c69ee9fdca5b9319b.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a journey filled with dread and atmosphere. Haunted by shadows of the past, Silver Pines is waiting to reveal its dark secrets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/1a53b9325826688be5c1532228fc3465.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/1a53b9325826688be5c1532228fc3465.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/1a53b9325826688be5c1532228fc3465.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">***</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/8727be90d2e38f928324fd3cd45dd2c7.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/8727be90d2e38f928324fd3cd45dd2c7.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/8727be90d2e38f928324fd3cd45dd2c7.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A love letter to classic survival horror. Fight or avoid the horrors of the town as you scavenge for resources and solutions to the puzzles blocking your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/7dd659f54fbcc1bd831251f0e3683a24.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/7dd659f54fbcc1bd831251f0e3683a24.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/7dd659f54fbcc1bd831251f0e3683a24.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/af150431ec7f87ac1f56350c8507469c.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/af150431ec7f87ac1f56350c8507469c.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/af150431ec7f87ac1f56350c8507469c.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Filled with locked doors and hidden paths, every turn holds an uncovered clue, a resource, or something waiting in the dark. With better tools and weapons more and more of the town becomes accessible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/542db35391351bdac12b5f8fb4c2eb1c.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/542db35391351bdac12b5f8fb4c2eb1c.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/542db35391351bdac12b5f8fb4c2eb1c.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/6b9866e7208f0024bd1f5e9d0ba6e6e0.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/6b9866e7208f0024bd1f5e9d0ba6e6e0.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/6b9866e7208f0024bd1f5e9d0ba6e6e0.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The horrors of the town include a large variety of challenging monsters and hulking bosses that keeps every encounter tense and dangerous.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/d73cc8971d663138d581f528d2f75c5e.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/d73cc8971d663138d581f528d2f75c5e.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/d73cc8971d663138d581f528d2f75c5e.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">***</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/4e3fe98dc7e54140cbcc4d01f0fdfc7e.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=164 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/4e3fe98dc7e54140cbcc4d01f0fdfc7e.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/4e3fe98dc7e54140cbcc4d01f0fdfc7e.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inventory space is limited. Search everywhere for items because every bullet, bottle of medicine and upgrade matters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/87068e7711486141cb266d8a237818e0.poster.avif?t=1791483390\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/87068e7711486141cb266d8a237818e0.webm?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2333000/extras/87068e7711486141cb266d8a237818e0.mp4?t=1791483390\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-4460 or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NIVIDIA GeForce GTX 660 Ti, AMD Radeon R9 270X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-6600 or AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NIVIDIA GeForce GTX 770, AMD Radeon R9 380<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 5 GB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Indie","RPG"],"developers":["Wych Elm"],"publishers":["Team17"],"release_date":"8 Oct, 2026","metacritic_score":84}